    "body": "Qualify the published SDK 4.1.0 and Tenants 7.0.2 package cohort with the published Builds 4.44.3 tool and catalog. Retain the finite Parties 3.0.0 and Memories 3.0.23 package selections, exact public reader closure and existing refusal controls.\n\nSource: `ae7516ee6961dd31a5e319be59ead76449ab04a0`.\nBuilds source: `fc2122240a39f03628c04fa8433e5eece90b8b4c` ([Builds v4.44.3](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/releases/tag/v4.44.3)).\n\nThe [exact-source tuple CI preflight](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Platform/actions/runs/42014821187) and [catalog builder consumer binding](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Platform/actions/runs/42014778312) completed successfully. Publication follows the explicit workspace synchronization and release request.\n\nThis Platform source release establishes a versioned identity for downstream build preparation. Downstream consumers must still pass their own exact-source CI and publication checks. It grants no production deployment or live runtime acceptance.\n"
